<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1800s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 19th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1800s BCE, 53 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 14 were founded and 3 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Middle Kingdom of Egypt, the Assyrian Empire and the Elamite Confederation.</p></header>
